        "title": "A View Matrix Becomes a Second Manifest",
        "description": "Encoding every port by every zoom level would recreate a bulky registry and obscure graph structure.",
        "likelihood": "high",
        "impact": "high",
        "mitigation": "Keep the authored minimum small: port-specific Detail plus node-shared Summary/Icon/Glyph, with explicit delegation and deterministic fallback.",
